  "description": "Narrow Western is a bold and condensed vintage display font inspired by classic western typography and old frontier signage. Its tall, narrow letterforms give it a strong and distinctive presence, making it perfect for logos, posters, branding, packaging, t-shirt designs, and rustic-themed projects. This font combines a traditional western feel with a clean and modern structure, making it versatile for both retro and contemporary designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Narrow Western is a bold and condensed vintage display font inspired by classic western typography and old frontier signage. Its tall, narrow letterforms give it a strong and distinctive presence, making it perfect for logos, posters, branding, packaging, t-shirt designs, and rustic-themed projects. This font combines a traditional western feel with a clean and modern structure, making it versatile for both retro and contemporary designs.</p>",
